From 73074802c0dd3a0ea1859a66a1847bc2edda310f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:41:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [TEE Soft Emu] Add manual Keybox online
 updates for TEE Soft Emu

Add an Advanced page with a user-defined update URL, RAW and Base64
content modes, and the latest update result. Leave the source unset
and provide no bundled sources or example URLs.

Share configuration management between both pages, preserving unrelated
fields when saving. Route local imports and online updates through a
single background worker with bounded downloads, lightweight XML and
required-field checks, and atomic file replacement with rollback on
configuration activation failure.

Change-Id: If393a01465ca8a36578d29deb735c09cfa1fdb2c
